OL,3,GNEWSAMasseuse fits rape alarm in
OL,4,Atreatment room after men treat her like
OL,5,A'a sex worker'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 26-year-old masseuse says she
OL,8,Freceives so many inappropriate messages
OL,9,Ffrom men that she has started carrying
OL,10,Fa rape alarm.
OL,12,FFfion Price, from Gilwern, near
OL,13,FAbergavenny, said she even had one
OL,14,Fphysical experience which put her in a
OL,15,F"very vulnerable situation", despite
OL,16,Fyears of professional training.
OL,18,FShe has fitted a rape alarm in her
OL,19,Ftreatment room and CCTV outside the
OL,20,Fbuilding, and no longer accepts male
OL,21,Fclients when she is working alone.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
